### Rebase & Create Pull Request

1. Rebase: `git fetch origin && git rebase origin/main` — resolve any conflicts
2. Push the branch: `git push -u origin HEAD`
3. Create PR: `gh pr create --title "..." --body "..."`
   - Title: concise summary of what's shipping
   - Body: use the PR Body Template below
4. Wait for CI to pass
5. Run the [Merge](#merge) gates and, if they pass, merge
6. Run [Deploy](#deploy) detection and execute what it finds
7. Report the PR URL and deploy result to the user

